Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪\NThe dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪\NI won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪\NA red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪\NGalloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Sore ga atashi ♪\NThat’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪\N-
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪\N-
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪\N-
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪\N-
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪\NThe Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪\NTruly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ Atashi nano sa ♪\NIt’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Fifteenth Episode\NThe Fox's Tale\NGolden Fox Hunt
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.30,0:02:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.59,0:03:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,There they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.44,0:03:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,As the fox proverb goes, where there are humans, there is food.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.77,0:04:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a bit risky, but let me help myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.69,0:04:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Has no one mentioned Zuru's name during this year's fox hunt?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.16,0:04:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Zuru?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.80,0:04:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you mean that crafty vixen?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.12,0:04:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,She always gives us trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.29,0:04:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a monster fox who speaks human words
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.11,0:04:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,and possesses wisdom beyond any human.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.48,0:04:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,She truly is quite something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.37,0:04:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Since she understands our speech, she sees through everything humans do and outsmarts us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.67,0:04:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,She's completely impossible to handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.28,0:04:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This time, I'd love to hang her pelt in my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.93,0:04:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, that golden fur is valuable, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.75,0:04:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Catching her would make it a national treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.87,0:04:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Where could that Zuru be hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.61,0:04:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this useless mutt dawdling for?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.19,0:04:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry into the forest!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.86,0:04:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like they were bitten by a beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.54,0:04:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, then it can't be helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.33,0:05:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Who on earth did this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.77,0:05:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,My precious booze is ruined!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.09,0:05:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,There's sand in here instead of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.32,0:05:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a frog in this pot!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.40,0:05:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like the meat is fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.94,0:05:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,...Wait, she got to this one, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.53,0:05:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Zuru showed up? Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.90,0:05:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not the type to show her tail.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.11,0:05:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But no one except Zuru could pull off a heist this slick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.20,0:05:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, there are footprints over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.25,0:05:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, no doubt about it. It's Zuru.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.18,0:05:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like she fled into the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.66,0:05:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Humans are so foolish.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.85,0:06:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still starving!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.97,0:06:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you think I'd give up that easily?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.56,0:06:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I made those footprints walking backward!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.83,0:06:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.45,0:06:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.38,0:06:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,A letter has arrived at the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.25,0:06:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's from Prince Franz.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.88,0:06:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,From Prince Franz?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.32,0:06:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you, Prince Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.10,0:06:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you found the flaxen-haired girl I danced with yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.12,0:06:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Flaxen-haired...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.25,0:06:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome, Prince Franz.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.05,0:06:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.87,0:07:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He couldn't tell...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.92,0:07:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't he figure out that I'm the flaxen-haired girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.60,0:07:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Zuru!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.29,0:07:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you, Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.73,0:07:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.51,0:07:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.74,0:07:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What a strange prince. Aren't you actually a princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.34,0:07:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.27,0:07:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait Zuru!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.05,0:07:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.66,0:08:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.52,0:08:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Get down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.42,0:08:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,To think a human would fall for a trap made by humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.69,0:08:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.69,0:08:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.58,0:08:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's sneaky, Zuru! Sneaky!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.73,0:08:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I smell iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.58,0:08:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out! Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.76,0:08:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,A human scent?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.09,0:08:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong with your nose?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.34,0:09:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really think you can catch me with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.65,0:09:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You got me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.13,0:09:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I did it! I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.96,0:09:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Plastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.32,0:09:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Papa, Papa! Look at this cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.06,0:09:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.66,0:09:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.74,0:09:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Plastic, you've grown up so splendidly!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.75,0:09:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So kingly!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.25,0:09:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I can't wait to see you become the true king!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.38,0:09:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna be the king!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.36,0:09:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.34,0:09:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,To do that, we must deal with Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.36,0:09:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Popa, I wanna be the king!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.33,0:09:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.46,0:09:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why Papa has to work so hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.23,0:09:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I wanna be the king!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.93,0:09:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop throwing a tantrum and shoot the bow like a noble future king!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.01,0:10:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.65,0:10:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.60,0:10:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That rascal, Zuru!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.51,0:10:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.25,0:10:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't fall for that trick!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.01,0:10:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If you kill her, you'll win today's top honors!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.38,0:10:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We can put Sapphire to shame!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.28,0:10:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.23,0:10:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You fool, what are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.19,0:10:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But Papa, you told me to hit it with the bow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.60,0:10:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it over!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.75,0:10:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot it with an arrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.81,0:10:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Duke, so this is where you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.96,0:10:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Lord Nylon. How was the castle inspection?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.91,0:10:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.29,0:10:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,taking advantage of Sapphire's absence, I searched his room and found...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.14,0:10:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,this box.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.14,0:10:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like a woman's item...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.32,0:10:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's proof inside that he's a woman, we've hit the jackpot!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.43,0:10:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Only a man can be king!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.10,0:10:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll send Sapphire to the scaffold for posing as a prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.50,0:11:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And then your son, Lord Plastic, as the King's relative, will become the next king...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.19,0:11:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on, open it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.77,0:11:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,"Thanks for your trouble, you blind fools of the castle!"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.36,0:11:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.10,0:11:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He's making fools of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.69,0:11:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What's so funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.21,0:11:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You said "blind fools," didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.92,0:11:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want proof that the prince is a girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.38,0:11:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,W-What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.51,0:11:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I happen to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.58,0:11:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you everything if you help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.48,0:11:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.45,0:11:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to find Sapphire fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.13,0:11:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.64,0:11:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.25,0:11:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.30,0:11:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.05,0:11:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.89,0:11:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.30,0:12:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Usagi-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.90,0:12:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you seen a girl... I mean, boy named Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.28,0:12:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That boy is sleeping in a pitfall right over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.22,0:12:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.42,0:12:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.63,0:12:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.87,0:12:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.26,0:12:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.33,0:12:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Zuru's going to tell Grand Duke Duralumin that you're a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.94,0:12:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,To Duralumin?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.20,0:12:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hurry and grab onto this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.79,0:12:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.70,0:12:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where's Zuru?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.16,0:12:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.96,0:12:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, um, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.04,0:12:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot which way she went...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.06,0:12:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez, forgetting something so important! You really are dumb, Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.17,0:12:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Mind your own business! I don't need you calling me dumb!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.57,0:12:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hunting isn't something a girl should be doing anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.73,0:12:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just a kid, keep quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.11,0:12:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You keep calling me a kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.38,0:12:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you just a kid yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.26,0:13:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, coming to ruin the Peaceful Forest with a hunt is wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.08,0:13:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,A-Alright, Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.87,0:13:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll search for him by myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.39,0:13:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Bleehhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.26,0:13:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But Sapphire's secret will be exposed...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.82,0:13:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, we can't let that happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.57,0:13:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.42,0:13:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Mogura-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.21,0:13:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I've found a lead, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.57,0:13:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Papa, can I kill this fox?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.23,0:13:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Papa, this fox... Don't kill it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.66,0:13:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Shhh! That's enough of that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.34,0:13:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,No fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.36,0:13:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who wants to get the credit!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.93,0:13:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Be good and wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.48,0:14:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I have proof the Prince is a girl, I'll let you strike that fox down immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.12,0:14:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.72,0:14:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough already!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.84,0:14:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You promised you'd talk once your stomach was full!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.89,0:14:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,My, humans are so impatient.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.36,0:14:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll take the rest home as a treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.88,0:14:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, now talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.50,0:14:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No. First, we must perform a Fox Tribe ritual.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.66,0:14:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,A ritual?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.54,0:14:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that supposed to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.15,0:14:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a ritual to swear that my story is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.50,0:14:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.92,0:14:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,A few sulfur rock fragments and a pile of juniper leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.69,0:14:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to do a ritual with {\i1}that{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.28,0:14:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Nylon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.04,0:14:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind that, hurry up and gather them!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.27,0:14:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I beat him up when we're finished?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.69,0:14:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Lord Nylon, please light the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.66,0:14:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Light it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.63,0:14:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's to offer a prayer to our Ancestral Fairy. Go ahead and light it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.82,0:15:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Look at all this smoke!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.17,0:15:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Zuru's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.52,0:15:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Search!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.61,0:15:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Search!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.26,0:15:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I got it, Mogura-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.95,0:15:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, I've got it, I've got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.90,0:15:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.43,0:16:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.36,0:16:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, did you find Zuru?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.56,0:16:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Mogura-kun told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.75,0:16:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He said she's near the swamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.28,0:16:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,There she is!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.76,0:16:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Zuru!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.24,0:16:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't get away this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.98,0:16:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me, sir! I can't die in a place like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.21,0:16:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,My sweet children are waiting for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.56,0:16:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Trying to play the pity card, Zuru?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.15,0:16:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't be fooled by a fox ever again!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.00,0:16:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to die, I don't want to die, I don't want to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.07,0:16:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My three babies will die too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.61,0:16:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,My little ones, your mother is going to be killed...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.78,0:16:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,...by these heartless humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.28,0:16:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.62,0:16:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there really a child like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.21,0:16:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.19,0:16:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,A cute little thing like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.82,0:16:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, you cheat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.41,0:16:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,As you can see, if you don't want your friend to get bitten, disarm the trap...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.23,0:17:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it off, Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.26,0:17:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll hold onto this child for later.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.65,0:17:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, that golden fox! Now I'm really mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.64,0:17:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.60,0:17:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Zuru, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.60,0:18:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Zuru.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.32,0:18:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Just surrender quietly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.14,0:18:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.55,0:18:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot if you dare. This kid will die with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.46,0:18:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.30,0:18:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,A dead kid or two won't bother us at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.37,0:18:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Humans are so much worse than foxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.14,0:18:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright. Just capture me already.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.13,0:18:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't listen to Nylon's orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.06,0:18:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.29,0:18:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no escaping now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.50,0:18:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm no fool, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.06,0:18:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I only run when I can get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.42,0:18:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, a bear!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.82,0:19:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,My babies!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.75,0:19:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,My babies!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.94,0:19:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,After her! After her!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.06,0:19:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out! Both of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.82,0:19:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Zuru's going to be killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.92,0:19:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't win with brains, so you're resorting to brute force, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.92,0:20:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So the story about the three babies wasn't a lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.95,0:20:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Zuru, I'll save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.97,0:20:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Was Sapphire after Zuru too?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.44,0:20:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, big guy, you're fighting me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.27,0:20:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Zuru, stay there and protect the babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.00,0:20:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to hurry and help Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.51,0:21:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, look, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.38,0:21:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you come to help me too, Mr. Mole?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.78,0:21:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.81,0:21:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.90,0:21:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.04,0:21:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You saved me, Master Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.21,0:21:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, bravo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.29,0:21:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.84,0:21:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay, Tink.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.97,0:21:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, I wonder if Kuma-san is okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.42,0:21:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go check!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.56,0:21:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure are busy, Tink.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.44,0:21:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Kuma-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.37,0:21:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a fine display of fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.66,0:21:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But that fox is my son Plastic's prey!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.23,0:22:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hand her over at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.76,0:22:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.86,0:22:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never get your hands on Zuru!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.99,0:22:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially not someone like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.55,0:22:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Regardless of what you say, Zuru will come to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.96,0:22:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's better than having her beloved children killed alongside her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.28,0:22:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Zuru?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.39,0:22:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Zuru, don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.92,0:22:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.05,0:22:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Sapphire is actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.15,0:22:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.37,0:22:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,...a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.39,0:22:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.79,0:22:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't lie to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.94,0:22:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,For you, this is your...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.51,0:22:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,..WEAK SPOT
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.35,0:22:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You betrayed me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.90,0:22:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.41,0:22:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill both parent and children!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.95,0:23:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.57,0:23:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much, Kuma-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.38,0:23:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.37,0:23:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's not meet again. It's for the best. A fox is a fox, and a human is a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.56,0:23:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You saved me, I saved you. We're even.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.95,0:23:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's best if we say goodbye now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.12,0:23:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.24,0:23:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.17,0:23:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.60,0:23:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, I heard you fought a golden fox?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.13,0:23:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, though I let her get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.50,0:23:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,As expected of the Prince, a fine kill... Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.42,0:23:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.29,0:23:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I let her get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.08,0:23:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you let him get away!
